@startuml lld-vm-stack
title clox - Bytecode and stack state for "1 + 2 * 3"

participant "Chunk.code\n(vm.ip)" as IP
participant "vm.stack" as ST

note over IP
  code                         constants
  0000 OP_CONSTANT 0           [0] 1
  0002 OP_CONSTANT 1           [1] 2
  0004 OP_CONSTANT 2           [2] 3
  0006 OP_MULTIPLY
  0007 OP_ADD
  0008 OP_RETURN
  (Chunk.lines[i] = source line of byte i)
end note

IP -> ST : 0000 OP_CONSTANT 0  =>  [ 1 ]
IP -> ST : 0002 OP_CONSTANT 1  =>  [ 1 ][ 2 ]
IP -> ST : 0004 OP_CONSTANT 2  =>  [ 1 ][ 2 ][ 3 ]
IP -> ST : 0006 OP_MULTIPLY    =>  [ 1 ][ 6 ]
IP -> ST : 0007 OP_ADD         =>  [ 7 ]
IP -> ST : 0008 OP_RETURN      =>  pop 7, print it, stack empty
@enduml
